class Grant(BaseModel):
    """
    Scoped access for an agent: which sources, which senses, and optionally a time window. An agent key sees only what its grants allow; a request outside them fails with forbidden_sense (ADR 0024).
    """

    model_config = ConfigDict(
        extra='allow',
        populate_by_name=True,
    )
    id: Annotated[str, Field(pattern='^grt_[0-9A-HJKMNP-TV-Z]{26}$')]
    agent_id: str
    source_ids: Annotated[list[str], Field(min_length=1)]
    senses: Annotated[list[Sense], Field(min_length=1)]
    abilities: list[Literal['watch', 'history']]
    """
    What else the agent may do on these sources (ADR 0048): `watch` sets watches; `history` reads recorded data older than the last two hours (events, memory search, playback, clips, conversations). Live access (look, ask, listen, read environment) comes with the senses. Default both.
    """
    window: Window | None = None
    """
    Live access (look, ask, listen) only inside the window; recorded data only from inside it. Either end may be open.
    """
    created_at: AwareDatetime
    blurred_only: bool | None = None
    """
    The agent sees these sources only blurred (ADR 0068): snapshots, looks and answers have faces and plates blurred whatever the camera's setting, and recordings, clips and live view are refused. A blurred-only grant on a source wins over another grant on it. Default false.
    """


